  "description": [
    {
      "value": "<p>Tidal flats on the warm side of the archipelago belt, drained to a mirror twice each cycle and crossed by stake lines that are replaced between visits. All four recorded meetings have happened here, at the same stage of the tide, and none has lasted longer than the walk back. The ground itself carries the traffic of a great many feet.</p>",
      "inLanguage": [{ "id": ["core.peerdb.org", "LANGUAGE", "en-GB"] }]
    }
